  "steps": [
    "Heat the oven to 220 °C and line the base and sides of the tin with baking paper.",
    "Mix everything in a stand mixer with the paddle until smooth. Don't whip in air.",
    "Pour into the tin and bake for about 35 minutes: the top gets very dark but the centre still wobbles slightly.",
    "Cool at room temperature, then chill for at least 7 hours.",
    "Serve cold, plain or with chocolate sauce or doce de leite."
